        "PT teacher ki seeti pe bhaagta hua shehar.",
        "Geometry box mein chhupe huye woh chote se raaz,",
        "Duster ki udti dhool mein dabi dabi aawaaz.",
        "Third period mein desk ke neeche khulta tha tiffin,",
        "Aalu-poori ki khushboo se mehakta har ek din.",
        "Blackboard pe chalk ki cheekh thi, par hum befikr the,",
        "Marksheet ke darr mein bhi, dosti ke zikr the.",
